{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedural sandbox RPG where relationships matter as much as survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, ever-changing world filled with medieval ruins, hostile creatures, and meaningful encounters. Form a party of unique characters, each with their own personality, needs, and moral compass.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/d2115fa1da4fd5754474f94ea9e1c407.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/d2115fa1da4fd5754474f94ea9e1c407.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/d2115fa1da4fd5754474f94ea9e1c407.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During travels between locations, your companions will talk, argue, bond\u2026 or even betray each other. Their relationships evolve dynamically \u2014 friendships, rivalries, romances\u2026 or irreparable feuds may emerge.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/953e4ff7f2cf77fe994eaeecc837b99c.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/953e4ff7f2cf77fe994eaeecc837b99c.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/953e4ff7f2cf77fe994eaeecc837b99c.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources carefully: food, rest, and shelter are key to survival. Engage in turn-based combat with tactical depth, make choices that shape the story, and lead your party through an adventure where no two playthroughs are the same.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/024c76fc1798010bb308fedddbdf82e6.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/024c76fc1798010bb308fedddbdf82e6.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/024c76fc1798010bb308fedddbdf82e6.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world with high replayability<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/ddc46a79b6bd3dd0d08bece544f5a67b.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/ddc46a79b6bd3dd0d08bece544f5a67b.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/ddc46a79b6bd3dd0d08bece544f5a67b.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art aesthetic inspired by classic 2D RPGs<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/9320930073a64ed7dbdd07c78f15f11d.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/9320930073a64ed7dbdd07c78f15f11d.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/9320930073a64ed7dbdd07c78f15f11d.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical turn-based combat<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/4661676e13d755d37813148ca9d1ed84.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/4661676e13d755d37813148ca9d1ed84.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/4661676e13d755d37813148ca9d1ed84.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion system with dynamic personalities and relationships<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/e1c653d05a102c01555766121f6337a2.poster.avif?t=1774271844\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/e1c653d05a102c01555766121f6337a2.webm?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/e1c653d05a102c01555766121f6337a2.mp4?t=1774271844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mechanics: hunger, fatigue, and more<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883020/extras/fca7dd0ab9b774f87521c1f2a6a47ae5.poster.avif?t=177427184